      ":question/worked-solution": "We subtract the corresponding entries:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P-Q & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 3 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 8 & 1\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 8 & 9\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1-9 & 0-6 & 4-0 \\\\ 3-0 & 3-1 & 2-3 \\\\ 1-3 & 8-8 & 1-9\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & -6 & 4 \\\\ 3 & 2 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 0 & -8\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
