      ":question/worked-solution": "We subtract the corresponding entries:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P-Q & =\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 10 & 5 \\\\ -5 & 9 & -2 \\\\ 12 & 12 & -11\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & -11 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -4 & -10 \\\\ -6 & 6 & 10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}8-(-5) & 10-(-11) & 5-(-2) \\\\ -5-0 & 9-(-4) & -2-(-10) \\\\ 12-(-6) & 12-6 & -11-10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}13 & 21 & 7 \\\\ -5 & 13 & 8 \\\\ 18 & 6 & -21\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
