      ":question/problem": "What is $\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 4 & -4 \\\\ 6 & -7 & 0\\end{bmatrix} - \\begin{bmatrix}-10 & -11 & 6 \\\\ -11 & -7 & -11\\end{bmatrix}$?",
      ":question/worked-solution": "We subtract the corresponding entries:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 4 & -4 \\\\ 6 & -7 & 0\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}-10 & -11 & 6 \\\\ -11 & -7 & -11\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}7-(-10) & 4-(-11) & -4-6 \\\\ 6-(-11) & -7-(-7) & 0-(-11)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}17 & 15 & -10 \\\\ 17 & 0 & 11\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
